fect</highlight> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>הִתְנַבִּיתָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,16)\">1Sam 10:16</ref> 1 singular <bdbheb>הִנַּבֵּאתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 37:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,37,10)\">Ezek 37:10</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִתְנַבֵּא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,10)\">1Sam 10:10</ref> + 7 t.; 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>יִתְנַבְּאוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 11:25\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,25)\">Num 11:25</ref> + 5 t.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>הִנַּבְּאוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 23:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,13)\">Jer 23:13</ref> <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> <bdbheb>הִתְנַבּוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:13\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,13)\">1Sam 10:13</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מִתְנַבֵּא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 26:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,26,20)\">Jer 26:20</ref> + 9 t. Participle; — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>Prophesy</highlight> under influence of divine spirit: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> in the ecstatic state <ref ref=\"Num 11:25\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,25)\">Num 11:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 11:26\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,26)\">Num 11:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 11:27\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,27)\">Num 11:27</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), with music <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,5)\">1Sam 10:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,6)\">1Sam 10:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,10)\">1Sam 10:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:13\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,13)\">1Sam 10:13</ref>, in frenzy <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,20)\">1Sam 19:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:21\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,21)\">1Sam 19:21</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:23\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,23)\">1Sam 19:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 19:24\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(9,19,24)\">1Sam 19:24</ref> excited to violence <ref ref=\"1Sam 18:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,18,10)\">1Sam 18:10</ref> (= <bdbheb>מְשֻׁגָּע</bdbheb> <highlight>mad</highlight> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,11)\">2Kgs 9:11</ref>); <ref ref=\"Jer 29:26\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,26)\">Jer 29:26</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> apart from ecstatic state, absolute <ref ref=\"Ezek 37:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,37,10)\">Ezek 37:10</ref>, with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,8)\">1Kgs 22:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 29:27\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,27)\">Jer 29:27</ref> <bdbheb>על</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:18\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,18)\">1Kgs 22:18</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,17)\">2Chr 18:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,7)\">2Chr 18:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:37\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,37)\">2Chr 20:37</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּשֵׁם י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 26:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,26,20)\">Jer 26:20</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> of heathen prophets of Baal in ecstatic state <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:29\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,29)\">1Kgs 18:29</ref> <bdbheb>בַּבַּעַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 23:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,23,13)\">Jer 23:13</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> of false prophets <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,10)\">1Kgs 22:10</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,9)\">2Chr 18:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 14:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,14,14)\">Jer 14:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 13:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,13,17)\">Ezek 13:17</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Jer 20:1", "book": "JER", "chapter": 20, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Jer 20:6", "book": "JER", "chapter": 20, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Jer 26:9", "book": "JER", "chapter": 26, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezek 37:7", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 37, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Jer 2:8", "book": "JER", "chapter": 2, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Jer 23:21", "book": "JER", "chapter": 23, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Amos 3:8", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 3, "verse": 8}, {"raw"